{"id": "21-712-2-4", "zh": "209.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-713-2-8", "zh": "屋顶像金翅鸟双翼那样弯曲的房屋，叫作半屋（aḍḍhayoga）；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-714-2-4", "zh": "带有一个尖顶的楼阁叫作圆顶阁（māḷa），", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-715-2-4", "zh": "四方形的叫作殿楼（pāsāda）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-716-2-4", "zh": "210.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-717-2-9", "zh": "表示会堂的词有：会堂（sabhā）、亭舍（maṇḍapa，也作阳性）、众人聚集处（janālaya）；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-718-2-7", "zh": "表示坐堂的，叫作退坐处（paṭikkamana）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-719-2-4", "zh": "211.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-720-2-8", "zh": "胜者（佛陀）居住的房舍，叫作香室（gandhakuṭi，阴性）；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-721-2-8", "zh": "表示厨房的词有：厨房（rasavatī，阴性）、烹煮处（pākaṭṭhāna）、大厨房（mahānasa）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-722-2-4", "zh": "212.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-723-2-8", "zh": "工坊（āvesana）就是技艺堂（sippasālā）；酒馆（soṇḍā）就是饮酒的房舍（pānamandira）；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-724-2-8", "zh": "便处（vaccaṭṭhāna）就是厕所（vaccakuṭi）；牟尼们的住处叫作道院（assama）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-725-2-4", "zh": "213.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-726-2-7", "zh": "售卖货物的房舍叫作店铺（āpaṇa），也叫货街（paṇyavīthikā）；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-727-2-8", "zh": "库房（udosita）就是货栈（bhaṇḍasālā）；经行道（caṅkamana）也叫经行处（caṅkama）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-728-2-4", "zh": "214.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-729-2-7", "zh": "热浴房（jantāghara）就是火堂（aggisālā）；施水亭（papā）就是饮水棚（pānīyasālikā）；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-730-2-9", "zh": "内室叫作 gabbha、ovaraka；卧房（vāsāgāra）就是寝室（sayanigaha）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-731-2-4", "zh": "215.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-732-2-10", "zh": "后宫（itthāgāra）又叫 orodha、suddhanta，也叫 antepura；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-733-2-7", "zh": "国王那些不许所有人进入的处所，叫作内苑（kacchantara）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-734-2-4", "zh": "216.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-735-2-6", "zh": "台阶叫作 sopāna，也叫 ārohaṇa，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-736-2-6", "zh": "梯子叫作 nisseṇī，也叫 adhirohiṇī；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-737-2-8", "zh": "窗户叫作 vātapāna、gavakkha、jāla、sīhapañjara。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-738-2-4", "zh": "217.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-739-2-11", "zh": "窗户也称为 ālokasandhi；门闩叫作 laṅgī（阴性），也叫 paligha；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-740-2-9", "zh": "门闩桩（kapisīsa）就是闩柱（aggalatthambha）；屋檐边叫作 nibba。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-741-2-4", "zh": "218.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-742-2-10", "zh": "屋顶叫作 chadana、paṭala、chadda；庭院叫作 ajira、caccara、aṅgaṇa；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-743-2-9", "zh": "门廊叫作 paghāna、paghana、alinda；门前的构架叫作 pamukha。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-744-2-4", "zh": "219.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-745-2-9", "zh": "门框（piṭṭhasaṅghāṭaka）就是门柱（dvārabāhā）；屋尖（kūṭa）也叫 kaṇṇikā；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-746-2-10", "zh": "门叫作 dvāra，也叫 paṭihāra；门槛叫作 ummāra，也叫 dehanī（阴性）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-747-2-4", "zh": "220.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-748-2-9", "zh": "门槛桩叫作 eḷaka，也叫 indakhīla；柱子叫作 thambha，也叫 thūṇa（阳性与阴性都用）；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-749-2-10", "zh": "半月形的门前石叫作 pāṭikā；砖叫作 giñjakā，也叫 iṭṭhakā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-750-2-4", "zh": "221.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-751-2-8", "zh": "覆盖屋脊的弯曲椽木，叫作 gopānasī（阴性）；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-752-2-8", "zh": "鸽舍叫作 viṭaṅka（非阴性）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-753-2-4", "zh": "222.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-754-2-9", "zh": "钥匙孔叫作 kuñcikāvivara，也叫 tāḷacchiggala；钥匙叫作 kuñcikā、", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-755-2-10", "zh": "tāḷa、avāpuraṇa；栏杆叫作 vedikā，也叫 vedi。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-756-2-4", "zh": "223.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-757-2-9", "zh": "椽架（saṅghāta）、侧梁（pakkhapāsa）、横梁（tulā）都是房屋的构件；", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-758-2-9", "zh": "扫帚叫作 sammujjanī、sammajjanī、sodhanī（阴性）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-759-2-4", "zh": "224.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-760-2-8", "zh": "垃圾场（saṅkaṭīra）就是倒垃圾的地方（saṅkāraṭṭhāna），也叫垃圾堆（saṅkārakūṭaka）；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-761-2-10", "zh": "垃圾叫作 kacavara、klāpa、saṅkāra，也叫 kasambu。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-762-2-4", "zh": "225.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-763-2-10", "zh": "房屋等的地基叫作宅地（vatthu）；村落叫作 gāma，也叫 saṃvasatha；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-764-2-21", "zh": "规模显著的村落叫作市镇（nigama）；在 macca 等词前加 adhi，表示享用其地的领主。〔复注本作：称为‘adhibhū’。〕", "confidence": 35}
{"id": "21-765-2-4", "zh": "226.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-766-2-6", "zh": "边界叫作 sīmā，也叫 mariyādā；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-767-2-4", "zh": "牧牛人的村子叫作 ghosa。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-768-2-4", "zh": "城市品结束。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "21-769-2-4", "zh": "3. 人品", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "21-770-2-4", "zh": "227.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-771-2-9", "zh": "人叫作 manussa、mānusa、macca、mānava、manuja、nara；", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-772-2-6", "zh": "男子叫作 posa、pumā、purisa、", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-773-2-5", "zh": "porisa；智者叫作 paṇḍita、", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-774-2-4", "zh": "228.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-775-2-10", "zh": "budha、vidvā、vibhāvī、santa、sappañña、kovida、", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-776-2-9", "zh": "dhīmā、sudhī、kavi、byatta、vicakkhaṇa、visārada、", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-777-2-4", "zh": "229.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-778-2-10", "zh": "medhāvī、matimā、pañña、viññū、vidura、vidū、", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-779-2-10", "zh": "dhīra、vipassī、dosaññū、buddha、dabba、viddasu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-780-2-4", "zh": "230.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-781-2-11", "zh": "女人叫作 itthī、sīmantinī、nārī、thī、vadhū、vanitā、aṅganā、", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-782-2-10", "zh": "pamadā、sundarī、kantā、ramaṇī、dayitā、abalā、", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-783-2-4", "zh": "231.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-784-2-9", "zh": "mātugāma、mahilā、lalanā、bhīru、kāminī；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-785-2-10", "zh": "少女叫作 kumārikā，也叫 kaññā；年轻女子叫作 yuvatī，也叫 taruṇī。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-786-2-4", "zh": "232.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-787-2-4", "zh": "受过灌顶的王后叫作 mahesī，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-788-2-4", "zh": "国王的其他妃嫔叫作 bhoginī；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-789-2-11", "zh": "前去赴约会的女子，叫作 abhisārikā。", "confidence": 75}
